Z||000000||mrfixit58||04-20-2000||07:37 PM||||I'm about to go look at a 88 GT with by Brother-in-Law. The owner said the A/C compressor is bad. Is the 88 compressor different from the 87 and if it is, does anyone know about how much they cost (just the compressor)? I've replaced a couple of compressors on 87s, are 88s any different?<P>Thanks for yor help,<BR>Roy||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||04-20-2000||07:42 PM||||Acording to my notes. All V6 Fiero use the same compressor. 84-86ish 4 cyl use the same compressor. 87-88 4 cyl use a completely diferant one from the others.||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfixit58||04-20-2000||10:28 PM||||Ogre,<P>That's great. At least I can help him fix the thing if he decides to buy it.<P>Thanks again,<BR>Roy||||reg||1
